{"schema":1,"revision":94612354,"page":{"pageid":1581534,"title":"東印度","displayTitle":"東印度","variant":"zh-tw"},"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"zh-Hant-TW\" dir=\"ltr\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r95173172\">.mw-parser-output .hatnote{font-size:small}.mw-parser-output div.hatnote{padding-left:2em;margin-bottom:0.8em;margin-top:0.8em}.mw-parser-output .hatnote-notice-img::after{content:\"\\202f \\202f \\202f \\202f \"}.mw-parser-output .hatnote-notice-img-small::after{content:\"\\202f \\202f \"}.mw-parser-output .hatnote+.mw-empty-elt+.hatnote{margin-top:-0.5em}body.skin-minerva .mw-parser-output .hatnote-notice-img,body.skin-minerva .mw-parser-output .hatnote-notice-img-small{display:none}@media print{body.ns-0 .mw-parser-output .hatnote{display:none!important}}</style><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\"><span class=\"noviewer hatnote-notice-img\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wikipedia:%E6%B6%88%E6%AD%A7%E4%B9%89\" title=\"Wikipedia:消歧義\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fb/Confusion_grey.svg/40px-Confusion_grey.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fb/Confusion_grey.svg/60px-Confusion_grey.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"260\" data-file-height=\"200\" /></a></span><b>提示</b>：此條目的主題不是<b><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%8D%B0%E5%BA%A6%E4%B8%9C%E9%83%A8\" title=\"印度東部\">印度東部</a></b>。</div> \n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Dampier,_Map_of_the_East_Indies.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b4/Dampier%2C_Map_of_the_East_Indies.jpg/330px-Dampier%2C_Map_of_the_East_Indies.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"174\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b4/Dampier%2C_Map_of_the_East_Indies.jpg/960px-Dampier%2C_Map_of_the_East_Indies.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1429\" data-file-height=\"829\" /></a><figcaption>William Dampiers map of 1697</figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>東印度</b>是一個模糊、鬆散的<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%9C%B0%E5%9F%9F\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"地域\">地域</a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5\" title=\"概念\">概念</a>，既適用於現在的<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%8D%B0%E5%BA%A6%E5%B0%BC%E8%A5%BF%E4%BA%9A\" title=\"印度尼西亞\">印尼</a>（前<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%8D%B7%E5%B1%AC%E6%9D%B1%E5%8D%B0%E5%BA%A6\" title=\"荷屬東印度\">荷屬東印度</a>），也可包括<a href=\"/wiki/%E9%A9%AC%E6%9D%A5%E7%BE%A4%E5%B2%9B\" title=\"馬來群島\">馬來群島</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>（<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%8F%B2%E5%BE%8B%E5%AE%BE\" title=\"菲律賓\">菲律賓</a>屬於本<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%BE%A4%E5%B2%9B\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"群島\">群島</a>）現在仍偶爾會這樣指稱。廣義的「東印度」還包括<a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B8%AD%E5%8D%97%E5%8D%8A%E5%B3%B6\" title=\"中南半島\">中南半島</a>（又稱<a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B8%AD%E5%8D%97%E5%8D%8A%E5%B3%B6\" title=\"中南半島\">印度支那</a>）和<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%8D%B0%E5%BA%A6%E6%AC%A1%E5%A4%A7%E9%99%B8\" title=\"印度次大陸\">印度次大陸</a>，以至伸延至整個<a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B8%9C%E5%8D%97%E4%BA%9A\" title=\"東南亞\">東南亞</a>和<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%8D%97%E4%BA%9A\" title=\"南亞\">南亞</a>。\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:East_and_West_Indies.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/ba/East_and_West_Indies.svg/330px-East_and_West_Indies.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"152\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/ba/East_and_West_Indies.svg/960px-East_and_West_Indies.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"2754\" data-file-height=\"1398\" /></a><figcaption><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r84565780\">.mw-parser-output .legend{page-break-inside:avoid;break-inside:avoid-column}.mw-parser-output .legend-color{display:inline-block;min-width:1.25em;height:1.25em;line-height:1.25;margin:1px 0;text-align:center;border:1px solid var(--border-color-notice,black);color:inherit}.mw-parser-output .legend-color-styled{display:inline-block;min-width:1.25em;height:1.25em;line-height:1.25;margin:1px 0;text-align:center;border:1px solid var(--border-color-notice,black);color:inherit}.mw-parser-output .legend-text{}</style><div class=\"legend\"><span class=\"legend-color mw-no-invert\" style=\"background-color:#F60; color:black;\">&#160;</span>&#160;<b>東印度</b></div> <link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r84565780\" /><div class=\"legend\"><span class=\"legend-color mw-no-invert\" style=\"background-color:#F96; color:black;\">&#160;</span>&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%8D%B0%E5%BA%A6\" title=\"印度\">印度</a>（<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%8D%B0%E5%BA%A6%E6%AC%A1%E5%A4%A7%E9%99%86\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"印度次大陸\">印度次大陸</a>和<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%BC%85%E7%94%B8\" title=\"緬甸\">緬甸</a>，參見<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%A4%A7%E5%8D%B0%E5%BA%A6\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"大印度\">大印度</a>。有時也包括<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%9D%B1%E5%8D%B0%E5%BA%A6%E7%BE%A4%E5%B3%B6\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"東印度群島\">東印度群島</a>）</div> <link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r84565780\" /><div class=\"legend\"><span class=\"legend-color mw-no-invert\" style=\"background-color:#F5DEB3; color:black;\">&#160;</span>&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A5%BF%E6%96%B0%E5%87%A0%E5%86%85%E4%BA%9A\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"西新幾內亞\">西新幾內亞</a></div> <link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r84565780\" /><div class=\"legend\"><span class=\"legend-color mw-no-invert\" style=\"background-color:#1E90FF; color:black;\">&#160;</span>&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A5%BF%E5%8D%B0%E5%BA%A6\" class=\"mw-disambig\" title=\"西印度\">西印度</a>（現今<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A5%BF%E5%8D%B0%E5%BA%A6%E7%BE%A4%E5%B2%9B\" title=\"西印度群島\">西印度群島</a>；歷史上包括整個<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%BE%8E%E6%B4%B2\" title=\"美洲\">美洲</a>）)</div> <link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r84565780\" /><div class=\"legend\"><span class=\"legend-color mw-no-invert\" style=\"background-color:#ADD8E6; color:black;\">&#160;</span>&#160;<b>有時被劃入西印度的國家</b></div></figcaption></figure>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"相關條目\"><span id=\".E7.9B.B8.E9.97.9C.E6.A2.9D.E7.9B.AE\"></span>相關條目</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E6%9D%B1%E5%8D%B0%E5%BA%A6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"編輯章節：相關條目\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A5%BF%E5%B1%AC%E6%9D%B1%E5%8D%B0%E5%BA%A6%E7%BE%A4%E5%B3%B6\" title=\"西屬東印度群島\">西屬東印度群島</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%8D%B7%E5%B1%AC%E6%9D%B1%E5%8D%B0%E5%BA%A6\" title=\"荷屬東印度\">荷屬東印度</a></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"注釋\"><span id=\".E6.B3.A8.E9.87.8B\"></span>注釋</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E6%9D%B1%E5%8D%B0%E5%BA%A6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"編輯章節：注釋\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Oxford_English_Dictionary\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Oxford English Dictionary\">OED first edition</a> <i>A geographical term, including Hindostan, Further India, and the islands beyond</i> with first found usage 1598</span>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"參考文獻\"><span id=\".E5.8F.83.E8.80.83.E6.96.87.E7.8D.BB\"></span>參考文獻</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E6%9D%B1%E5%8D%B0%E5%BA%A6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"編輯章節：參考文獻\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r95320392\">.mw-parser-output .reflist{margin-bottom:0.5em;list-style-type:decimal}@media screen{.mw-parser-output .reflist{font-size:90%}}.mw-parser-output .reflist .references{font-size:100%;margin-bottom:0;list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns{margin-top:0.3em}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns ol{margin-top:0}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns li{page-break-inside:avoid;break-inside:avoid-column}.mw-parser-output .reflist-upper-alpha{list-style-type:upper-alpha}.mw-parser-output .reflist-upper-roman{list-style-type:upper-roman}.mw-parser-output .reflist-lower-alpha{list-style-type:lower-alpha}.mw-parser-output .reflist-lower-greek{list-style-type:lower-greek}.mw-parser-output .reflist-lower-roman{list-style-type:lower-roman}</style><div class=\"reflist reflist-columns\" style=\"column-count: 2;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navbox-styles\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r95173189\">.mw-parser-output .hlist dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist ol,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul{margin:0;padding:0}.mw-parser-output .hlist dd,.mw-parser-output .hlist dt,.mw-parser-output .hlist li{margin:0;display:inline}.mw-parser-output .hlist.inline,.mw-parser-output .hlist.inline dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist.inline ol,.mw-parser-output .hlist.inline ul,.mw-parser-output .hlist dl dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist dl ol,.mw-parser-output .hlist dl ul,.mw-parser-output .hli